    {
      "key": "invMission",
      "theme": "orange",
      "html": "<div style=\"background:var(--secbg);padding:40px 48px 44px;text-align:center;\">\n      <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"TODAY’S ASSIGNMENT\" style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:4px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.8);margin-bottom:10px;\" class=\"\">Today's Assignment</div>\n      <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"DAY 07\" style=\"font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:52px;line-height:1;color:#fff;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:14px;\" class=\"\">Day 04</div>\n      <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"Collect Physical Evidence\" style=\"font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:26px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#fff;line-height:1.15;margin-bottom:12px;\" class=\"\">File a sleep report</div>\n      <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"Photograph today’s breakfast before you eat it. File it with the group.\" style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(255,255,255,.92);max-width:42ch;margin:0 auto 18px;\" class=\"\"><p style=\"margin: 0px auto 18px; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94); max-width: 44ch; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">Log last night's sleep — hours down, and how rested you felt out of five. Sleep is one of our prime suspects.</p></div>\n      <div style=\"display:inline-block;border:2px dashed rgba(255,255,255,.55);padding:8px 18px;\">\n        <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"EVIDENCE TYPE: PHOTOGRAPHIC\" style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#fff;\" class=\"\">EVIDENCE TYPE: PHYSICAL</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    "
    },
    {
      "key": "blogintro",
      "theme": "white",
      "html": "<div style=\"background:var(--secbg);padding:46px 7% 6px;\">\n      <div style=\"max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;\">\n        <p class=\"dropcap is-empty\" contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"Showing up fully — for your training, your work, your family, and yourself — starts the night before. Good sleep isn't about feeling rested. It's the single biggest lever most people never pull, and it quietly decides how every other habit pays off.\" style=\"font-size:21px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--sectext);font-weight:400;margin:0;\"></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 14px; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(84, 82, 78); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">You're four days in, Detective. The crime scene is mapped and the first pieces of evidence are on the board. Now we start watching one of the quietest suspects of all: <span style=\"color: rgb(26, 26, 26);\"><b>your sleep.</b></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 14px; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(84, 82, 78); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">Most people never connect how they eat with how they sleep — which is exactly why sleep gets away with so much. For the next few nights, we're putting it under surveillance.</p><p></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    "
    },
    {
      "key": "invFileChecklist",
      "theme": "white",
      "html": "<div style=\"background:var(--secbg);padding:36px 48px 40px;\">\n      <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"OPENING REPORT\" style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:4px;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:8px;\" class=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">TONIGHT'S EVIDENCE</span></div>\n      <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"File Your First Evidence\" style=\"font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:22px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--heading);margin-bottom:6px;\" class=\"\">LOG BEFORE BED &amp; AFTER WAKING</div>\n      <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"Takes two minutes. Log it in the form linked below.\" style=\"font-size:13.5px;color:#8a8781;margin-bottom:18px;\" class=\"is-empty\"></div>\n      <div class=\"li-list\" data-proto=\"&lt;div class=&quot;li-wrap&quot; style=&quot;position:relative;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e2ded6;&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;button class=&quot;li-del&quot; onclick=&quot;delLi(this)&quot;&gt;×&lt;/button&gt;\n        &lt;div style=&quot;width:15px;height:15px;border:2px solid var(--accent);flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;div style=&quot;flex:1;&quot;&gt;\n          &lt;div contenteditable=&quot;true&quot; data-ph=&quot;New item&quot; style=&quot;font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;color:var(--heading);margin-bottom:1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n          &lt;div contenteditable=&quot;true&quot; data-ph=&quot;What to record.&quot; style=&quot;font-size:12.5px;color:#8a8781;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;/div&gt;\" style=\"\"><div class=\"li-wrap\" style=\"position:relative;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e2ded6;\">\n        <button class=\"li-del\" onclick=\"delLi(this)\">×</button>\n        <div style=\"width:15px;height:15px;border:2px solid var(--accent);flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"flex:1;\">\n          <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"Starting stats\" style=\"font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;color:var(--heading);margin-bottom:1px;\" class=\"\">Hours slept</div>\n          <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"Weight or measurements — optional and private.\" style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a8781;line-height:1.5;\" class=\"\">Rough is fine - time in bed counts.</div>\n        </div>\n      </div><div class=\"li-wrap\" style=\"position:relative;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e2ded6;\">\n        <button class=\"li-del\" onclick=\"delLi(this)\">×</button>\n        <div style=\"width:15px;height:15px;border:2px solid var(--accent);flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"flex:1;\">\n          <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"Symptom checklist\" style=\"font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;color:var(--heading);margin-bottom:1px;\" class=\"\">Rested rating</div>\n          <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"Afternoon crashes, poor sleep, brain fog, cravings, low energy, joint pain, mood swings.\" style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a8781;line-height:1.5;\" class=\"\">How rested you felt on waking, 1 to 5.</div>\n        </div>\n      </div><div class=\"li-wrap\" style=\"position:relative;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e2ded6;\">\n        <button class=\"li-del\" onclick=\"delLi(this)\">×</button>\n        <div style=\"width:15px;height:15px;border:2px solid var(--accent);flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"flex:1;\">\n          <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"Baseline ratings\" style=\"font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;color:var(--heading);margin-bottom:1px;\" class=\"\">Woke before the alarm?</div>\n          <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"Energy, sleep, and mood — each on a scale of 1 to 5.\" style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a8781;line-height:1.5;\" class=\"\">Yes or no - a small clue that matters.</div>\n        </div>\n      </div></div>\n    <button class=\"li-add\" onclick=\"addLi(this)\">+ item</button>\n    </div>\n    "
    },
    {
      "key": "invTipOff",
      "theme": "cream",
      "html": "<div style=\"background:var(--secbg);padding:38px 48px 42px;\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px;\">\n        <span contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"ANONYMOUS TIP\" style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:4px;color:var(--accent);white-space:nowrap;\" class=\"\">ANONYMOUS TIP</span>\n        <span style=\"flex:1;height:1px;background:var(--accent);opacity:.4;\"></span>\n        <span contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"#014\" style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:var(--secmuted);\" class=\"is-empty\"></span>\n      </div>\n      <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"Read the label before you read the front of the box.\" style=\"font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:28px;line-height:1.2;color:var(--sectext);margin-bottom:12px;\" class=\"\">Whole30 sleep changes show up before the scale ever moves.</div>\n      <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"The front is marketing. The back is evidence. Sugar has more than fifty aliases and most of them live in the last three lines of the ingredient list.\" style=\"font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--secmuted);max-width:54ch;\" class=\"\">Watch for two things this week: falling asleep faster, and waking up a few minutes before your alarm feeling clear instead of groggy. Those are the first real pieces of evidence that something is working - so log them the moment you notice.</div>\n    </div>\n    \n    "
    },
    {
      "key": "invWeekLog",
      "theme": "white",
      "html": "<div style=\"background:var(--secbg);padding:30px 48px 34px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.10);\">\n      <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"WEEK 1 EVIDENCE — DAYS LOGGED\" style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--secmuted);margin-bottom:14px;text-align:center;\" class=\"\">WEEK 1 EVIDENCE - 4 of 7 days logged</div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n        <div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n        <div class=\"ev-box\" data-filled=\"1\" onclick=\"toggleEvidence(this)\" title=\"Click: solid = logged, outline = pending\" style=\"width:32px;height:32px;border:2px solid var(--accent);background:var(--accent);cursor:pointer;margin:0 auto 5px;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:9px;color:var(--secmuted);\">1</div>\n      </div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n        <div class=\"ev-box\" data-filled=\"1\" onclick=\"toggleEvidence(this)\" title=\"Click: solid = logged, outline = pending\" style=\"width:32px;height:32px;border:2px solid var(--accent);background:var(--accent);cursor:pointer;margin:0 auto 5px;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:9px;color:var(--secmuted);\">2</div>\n      </div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n        <div class=\"ev-box\" data-filled=\"1\" onclick=\"toggleEvidence(this)\" title=\"Click: solid = logged, outline = pending\" style=\"width:32px;height:32px;border:2px solid var(--accent);background:var(--accent);cursor:pointer;margin:0 auto 5px;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:9px;color:var(--secmuted);\">3</div>\n      </div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n        <div class=\"ev-box\" data-filled=\"1\" onclick=\"toggleEvidence(this)\" title=\"Click: solid = logged, outline = pending\" style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px; border: 2px solid var(--accent); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: var(--accent); cursor: pointer; margin: 0px auto 5px;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:9px;color:var(--secmuted);\">4</div>\n      </div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n        <div class=\"ev-box\" data-filled=\"0\" onclick=\"toggleEvidence(this)\" title=\"Click: solid = logged, outline = pending\" style=\"width:32px;height:32px;border:2px solid var(--accent);background:transparent;cursor:pointer;margin:0 auto 5px;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:9px;color:var(--secmuted);\">5</div>\n      </div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n        <div class=\"ev-box\" data-filled=\"0\" onclick=\"toggleEvidence(this)\" title=\"Click: solid = logged, outline = pending\" style=\"width:32px;height:32px;border:2px solid var(--accent);background:transparent;cursor:pointer;margin:0 auto 5px;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:9px;color:var(--secmuted);\">6</div>\n      </div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n        <div class=\"ev-box\" data-filled=\"0\" onclick=\"toggleEvidence(this)\" title=\"Click: solid = logged, outline = pending\" style=\"width:32px;height:32px;border:2px solid var(--accent);background:transparent;cursor:pointer;margin:0 auto 5px;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:9px;color:var(--secmuted);\">7</div>\n      </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    "
